<title>POLAND: Zywiec 9.9 pct surge surprises traders.</title>
<headline>Zywiec 9.9 pct surge surprises traders.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish brewer Zywiec SA soared 9.9 percent on low 0.7-million-zloty turnover to 149.5 zlotys but analysts could not explain the rise.</p>
<p>&quot;It did fall recently, so the price was attractive, but it's still difficult to say why the jump was so spectacular...,&quot; one trader said. The low turnover could have exaggerated the move, he said.</p>
<p>Zywiec fell 9.3 percent in the November 19-25 period.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
